"""Channels (Meta, Google), the office's own accounts, and the prototype's builder fields.

Existing campaigns keep what they had: a typed page handle becomes one of the
office's connected Instagram accounts (not verified yet), the old "connected
page" destination becomes "own account", and a project campaign gets the
project's developer. The handle field is removed after that.
"""

